+#
+# fuxi (Xiaomi 13, SM8550 "kalama"): a copy of MASTER.arm64.sweet. The feature
+# set is deliberately identical - every config_* option below is either
+# SoC-independent bring-up (nos_arm_asm, nos_arm_pmap, the kperf/kpc stub) or a
+# userland/filesystem need of the iOS 16 root (mockfs, sweet_hfs, bindfs,
+# nullfs) and applies to fuxi unchanged.
+#
+# SM6225/SM7150-specific entries that MUST be revisited for fuxi:
+#   * nos_arm_asm / nos_arm_pmap (KERNEL_BASE) and kperf/kpc: these drop
+#     Apple's closed, arm64e-only KDK libs. fuxi is plain arm64 too, so they
+#     stay - but kpc is a no-hardware stub (no PMU path yet) and kperf only
