+#   * Nothing in this file encodes the 16K-granule, ARMv8.0, LSE or PAN choices
+#     - those live in pexpert/pexpert/arm64/FUXI.h. fuxi is ARMv9 with PAN on
+#     and no -mcpu=cortex-a53 (see FUXI.h).
+#   * The driver gating (#if defined(SWEET) / ARM64_BOARD_CONFIG_SWEET) is
